        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "Abyss Passer, you've gone even deeper. I honestly didn't expect that."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "This isn't the real Helio, just a fragment of memory. And yet—"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"I\"",
            "I failed. We failed."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "Look, I came to tell you something. I can't exactly say it to the others. It'd kill morale."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He doesn't answer me. He just keeps going."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "I don't think the Millennium Project is going to succeed. Not in our hands, anyway."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "That's how science works, you know? Theory and discovery come first. Then proof takes decades, or sometimes centuries."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "So all those wild dreams I keep going on about, the ones everyone buys into, just so you know... we're probably going to fail."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"I\"",
            "\"Helio\"."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "Even so, I'm going to see it through. I want the Millennium Project to connect this millennium to the next, and the one after that."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "Just like how life is handed down, built on. So that the ones who come after us..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"Helio\"",
            "...can take our failure and use it to define their success."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The look on Dale's face is the same as mine."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"I\"",
            "Dale."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "I try to reach out, to get closer to him. But there is no strength left in me."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "So Dale leans down. He gathers us up in his arms."
        ]
    },
